# =============================================================================
# .gitignore — MAKE30 dynamic prediction pipeline
#
# PRIMARY PURPOSE: prevent any restricted PhysioNet data, derived cache, or
# data-derived model from ever entering version control. MIMIC-IV, eICU-CRD,
# and SICdb are credentialed/contributor-review datasets; their data and any
# row-level derivatives or trained models must NOT be redistributed.
# Only aggregate tables, figures, and JSON metric/schema bundles belong here.
# =============================================================================

# --- Restricted source data (NEVER commit) -----------------------------------
# Adjust these to wherever your local database roots live, but the safe default
# is to keep data entirely OUTSIDE the repo tree. These patterns are a backstop.
data/
raw/
mimic*/
eicu*/
sicdb*/
*.dcm
physionet.org/

# --- Derived cache / intermediate datasets (NEVER commit) ---------------------
# Row-level derived features = redistribution of restricted data.
cache/
*.parquet
*.feather
*.pkl
*.pickle
*.npy
*.npz
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.csv.gz

# --- Trained models derived from restricted data (NEVER commit) ---------------
# Per PhysioNet guidance, models derived from MIMIC are treated as sensitive and
# should be shared on PhysioNet under the source DUA — not on open repositories.
*.joblib
*.model
*.txt.model
*.lgb
*.bin
*.onnx
*.ckpt
*.pt
*.pth
models/
make30_dynamic_model.joblib

# --- ALLOWLIST: aggregate artifacts that ARE safe to commit -------------------
# (Re-include the specific aggregate JSON files that the broad rules above would
#  otherwise have to worry about. CSV tables and PNG figures are not ignored.)
!results_bundle.json
!feature_manifest.json
# tables/*.csv and figures/*.png are intentionally NOT ignored.

# --- Jupyter ------------------------------------------------------------------
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*-checkpoint.ipynb
# Tip: run `nbstripout --install` so notebook OUTPUTS (which can embed
# identifiers/row previews) are cleared automatically on commit.

# --- Python -------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.Python
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# --- Virtual environments -----------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/
.conda/
conda-meta/

# --- Tooling / caches ---------------------------------------------------------
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints
.coverage
htmlcov/

# --- Environment / secrets ----------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.local
config.local.*

# --- OS / editor --------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# --- Logs ---------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
logs/
